//! Native reference counting and cycle collection from the pinned QuickJS source.
//!
//! All entry points require one exclusively executing runtime. A copied ValueBits/pointer
//! is only a borrowed alias; release consumes one previously owned strong reference.
//! Published GC cells occur in exactly one runtime GC list. Roots retain explicitly.
//! No payload borrow is held across a finalizer, weak callback, or child release.
//! Tracing changes headers/lists only, allocates nothing, and never invokes JS code.
//! Object freeMark is set before releasing properties; a marked object's shape pointer
//! is a dead sentinel and MUST NOT be dereferenced (the native field is nonnullable).
//! Native class callbacks own payload edges, never the structural shape/properties.

